  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Australia Partnership Phase 1 - Laos Economic Resilience Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Australia Partnership (MAP) Economic Resilience pillar funded activities in Laos are providing targeted support across a range of its priority areas, including supporting Public Financial Management reforms. Building capacity in this area is equipping decision-makers with the tools they need to make well informed and timely policy decisions that will impact the long-term prosperity of Laos.  Specific areas of engagement include State Owned Enterprise reform, tax administration and debt management, and better management of the education budget.</narrative>
  </description>
